OL,3,A'Click, don't pick' warning as fungi
OL,4,Aposts mushroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media posts showcasing fungi
OL,7,Fpicking is affecting a forest's
OL,8,Fecosystem, according to officials.
OL,10,FPicking wild mushrooms from Epping
OL,11,FForest in Essex is banned under by-laws
OL,12,Fbut fungi-related content has surged in
OL,13,Fpopularity online.
OL,15,FForagers risk getting fined or
OL,16,Fprosecuted for picking the mushrooms,
OL,17,Fbut they can also be poisonous if
OL,18,Featen.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1788080141
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Click, don't pick' warning as fungi
OL,4,Aposts mushroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaroline Haines, the chair of the City
OL,7,FCorporation's Epping Forest and Commons
OL,8,FCommittee, said posts showing mushrooms
OL,9,Fbeing collected "can encourage others
OL,10,Fto follow suit" and urged people to
OL,11,F"click, don't pick".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
